      <open>0</open>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Mumbai</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>One of the best trips I had with Abinash and Smruti. We couldn't crack IIT, but got to visit Mood Indigo IIT Bombay xD, one of the best fests in India. We partied a lot! I got to know a lot about myself here.</p>
<p><b>2</b> visits · <b>1</b> day<br/>
Dec 28, 2024 — Dec 28, 2024</p>
<p style="color:#8C9AA8">Maharashtra, India</p>]]></description>
